commit 580f8c4767b2a69421f9a9c39e2822c58622b7d3
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 02:00:57 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board for the committee
    
    The task sheet export (incoming/tasks.csv) now builds into boards/tasks/:
    one section per person so each member can see what is theirs (Ines,
    12 Nov), unassigned tasks first under "Nobody yet" because the
    recurring failures in the minutes were jobs with no name (water meter,
    shed gutter), done tasks folded away (Tomas), overdue/due-within-7-days
    flagged, and the polytunnel rota from the sheet's side columns shown
    at the top (Dot; the September swap that went unseen).
    
    kit/board.py gains a mode for boards whose sections have no date
    (grouped by a field, rows ordered by a "date" column, done rows folded)
    plus "show_label" columns and an optional rota. Status words match
    case-insensitively and names group case-insensitively, so the export's
    "Done" and "priya" need no hand-editing. The events page builds
    byte-identical to before.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

