 boards/<name>/index.html. Rows are grouped into sections by the "section" field and ordered by the earliest date
 in each section; sections whose date has passed go under one fold at the bottom.
+
+If "section" has no "date" (the tasks board), sections are the field's values with blanks first under
+section["empty"], rows inside each are ordered by the column marked "date", and done rows go under one fold.
+A column marked "date" shows as "due <date>", flagged when overdue or due within 7 days of the build. An
+optional "rota" ({"week", "who", "title", "empty"}) is shown above the sections from this week onward.
